{"id":"bd304cf92255e65e","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md","title":"Schema Axioms Decidable","display":"thm-schema-axiom-decidable — Schema Axioms Decidable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable","aliases":["92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable"],"display":"thm-schema-axiom-decidable — Schema Axioms Decidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-schema]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schema-axiom-decidable — Schema Axioms Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e92d50fae9055cf8\" href=\"?note=e92d50fae9055cf8\" title=\"92-df-schema\">92-df-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (syntactic template domain and map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e92d50fae9055cf8\" href=\"?note=e92d50fae9055cf8\" title=\"92-df-schema\">92-df-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)\\)</span> (schema instance set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total recursive-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G,A_T\">\\(\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G,A_T\\)</span> (definition targets for a total recursive matcher and the code set of schema instances)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schema\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(m)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[m(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in A_T\\bigr]\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schema\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(m)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[m(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in A_T\\bigr]\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只有在模板匹配与参数域成员关系可判定时，模式实例的码集才可判定</li>\n<li>任意可计算模板的值域一般只能保证CE，不能无条件保证可判定</li>\n<li>这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\)</span>已展开为一个对所有自然数编码（包括非法公式码）均停机的布尔匹配器，而非未定义的口头条件</li>\n<li>对PA的标准语法编码，下列各类模式均有这样的解析与匹配程序：\n<ul>\n<li>命题公理模式</li>\n<li>谓词公理模式</li>\n<li>归纳公理模式</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>再结合有限并的封闭性，PA的标准公理码集是递归可判定的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-schema","status":"resolved","id":"e92d50fae9055cf8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-schema","status":"resolved","id":"e92d50fae9055cf8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ and $T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (syntactic template domain and map, see [[92-df-schema]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G$ (Gödel-code image constructor, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T:D\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G,A_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schema\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Schema}_G(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(m)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[m(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in A_T\\bigr]\\Bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(A_T)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MatchDec}_G(T,D)","display":false}],"bytes":1880,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injec